```

The documentation snapshot also states that side categorical legends accept only one column, so increasing the canvas margin cannot solve this.

## Requested behavior

Allow categorical legends at `left` or `right` to use an explicit positive column count.

Acceptance cases:

1. The reproduction renders three legend columns on the right.
2. The side legend reserves its measured width and does not overlap the plot.
3. Symbol, label, title, gap, and ordering settings continue to work with multiple columns.

