## Problem

Long or rotated tick labels force authors to coordinate canvas width/height, four margins, label offsets and title offsets. A 2×2 heatmap with authored step 15 must keep its inner plot 30×30. Allocating guide space should not require changing that data-region size.

In nine guide-heavy translated charts, canvas and initial guide configuration account for 187 of 336 measured nested option leaves. One accepted 30×30 heatmap needs a 538×500 outer canvas, left/bottom margins 420 and rotated-label offset 200. These are consequences of the current layout contract, not a request for identical incidental pixels.

## Executed reproduction

```js
