- `types/program.d.ts`: `AreaPlotIndependentChannel` admits quantitative/temporal branches only.
- Path materialization, series sorting, and area stack alignment must handle category identity/domain order consistently; relaxing the guards alone is insufficient.
- `src/actions/guides/axes/labels.js`: numeric rank + `labelMap` is also rejected. If rank recoding is the intended alternative, document and support its label contract rather than suggesting a recipe that fails.

Relevant source: [area facade](https://github.com/ggaction/ggaction/blob/main/src/actions/charts/area.js), [position compatibility](https://github.com/ggaction/ggaction/blob/main/src/grammar/positionCompatibility.js), [axis labels](https://github.com/ggaction/ggaction/blob/main/src/actions/guides/axes/labels.js).

