`createDumbbellPlot` with separate start/end fields throws while inferring its default value-axis title. This prevents an otherwise complete minimal chart from being created with default guides.

Observed in a local source snapshot whose package version is 0.0.12 (with unrelated teaser edits to rose/color-scale actions). I have not confirmed this on current upstream HEAD; please treat that version scope explicitly.

